#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:920
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_EnergyGuruSellWhatYouNeed"
msgid ""
"I'm the ENERGY GURU! I'll go for it and\n"
"sell you what you need!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:924
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_OhYourPokemon"
msgid ""
"Oh?\n"
"Your {STR_VAR_1}…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:928
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_PleaseGiveItThisEffortRibbon"
msgid ""
"Went for it stupendously!\p"
"As its reward, please give it this\n"
"EFFORT RIBBON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:933
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_ReceivedEffortRibbon"
msgid "{PLAYER} received the EFFORT RIBBON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:936
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_PutEffortRibbonOnMon"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} put the EFFORT RIBBON\n"
"on {STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:940
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_GoForItLittleHarder"
msgid ""
"You have to go for it a little harder.\p"
"If you do, I'll give your POKéMON\n"
"something nice.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:945
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_EffortRibbonLooksGoodOnIt"
msgid ""
"Oh! Your {STR_VAR_1}, that EFFORT\n"
"RIBBON looks good on it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:949
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_WonderIfLighthouseStartlesPokemon"
msgid ""
"The light of the lighthouse reaches\n"
"dozens of miles away.\p"
"I wonder if it doesn't startle POKéMON\n"
"in the sea.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:955
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_SeaweedFullOfLife"
msgid ""
"Ooh, look at this!\p"
"The seaweed you can get around these\n"
"parts is fresh and full of life.\p"
"Why, it looks like it can even rear up\n"
"and attack!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:962
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_HowTownIsBornAndGrows"
msgid ""
"Where the water is clean, the fruits\n"
"of bountiful harvest gather.\p"
"And where people gather, a market\n"
"soon starts.\p"
"That is how a town is born and grows.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:969
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_SlateportWonderfulPlace"
msgid ""
"Shopping where you can breathe the\n"
"scent of the ocean…\p"
"SLATEPORT is such a wonderful place!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:974
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_BuyBricksSoDecorWontGetDirty"
msgid ""
"If you put DOLLS or CUSHIONS on\n"
"the floor, they'll get dirty.\p"
"I'm going to buy some BRICKS so my\n"
"DOLLS and CUSHIONS won't get dirty\l"
"when I leave them out.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:981
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_GoingToCompeteInBattleTent"
msgid ""
"Wroooar! I'm going to compete in\n"
"the BATTLE TENT, too!\p"
"But before that, I need to catch\n"
"some POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:987
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_BushedHikingFromMauville"
msgid ""
"Whew… I'm just bushed…\p"
"I hiked over from MAUVILLE CITY.\n"
"But, boy, this city's huge.\p"
"If I'd known this, I would've ridden\n"
"my BIKE here.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:994
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_EveryoneCallsHimCaptStern"
msgid ""
"STERN, the fellow who built the\n"
"MUSEUM, also happens to be the leader\l"
"of an undersea exploration team.\p"
"So, everyone calls him CAPT. STERN.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1000
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_WhatsLongLineOverThere"
msgid ""
"What is that over there?\n"
"That long line…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1004
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_VisitedMuseumOften"
msgid ""
"When I was a child, I visited\n"
"the MUSEUM often.\p"
"I used to dream about the mysteries of\n"
"the sea after seeing the exhibits.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1010
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_QuitPushing"
msgid ""
"Hey, there! Quit pushing!\n"
"This is the line, can't you see?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1014
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_AquaHasPolicy"
msgid ""
"TEAM AQUA has a policy of\n"
"assembling and dispersing at\l"
"the operation site.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1019
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_BossIsBrilliant"
msgid ""
"Our BOSS is brilliant.\p"
"What would he want to do with\n"
"a MUSEUM now?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1024
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_WhatsNewSchemeIWonder"
msgid ""
"What's the new scheme, I wonder?\p"
"Our BOSS is scary when he's mad, so\n"
"I'd better not screw things up…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1029
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_ShouldTakeItAll"
msgid ""
"If there's something we need in\n"
"the MUSEUM, we should take it all!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1033
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_DontButtIn"
msgid ""
"Hey, you there!\n"
"Don't butt in!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1037
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_RemindsMeOfLongLineForGames"
msgid ""
"A long line, huh?\p"
"It reminds me of the times I lined up to\n"
"buy smash-hit games…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1042
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_WhyAreWeLiningUp"
msgid ""
"Why are we even lining up and paying?\n"
"We should just march in!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1046
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_WhatDoYouWant"
msgid ""
"What?\n"
"What do you want?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1050
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_IllReadSignForYou"
msgid ""
"You want to read this sign?\n"
"I'll read it for you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1054
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_SaysSomethingLikeSeaIsEndless"
msgid ""
"Let's see…\p"
"Um… I think it says something like\n"
"“the life in the sea is endless.”\p"
"Yup, I'm pretty sure that's what\n"
"it says.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1061
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_ShouldveBroughtMyGameBoy"
msgid ""
"Grumble…\p"
"I should've brought my Game Boy\n"
"Advance so I wouldn't get bored in line…\p"
"Grumble…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1067
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_HotSpringsAfterOperation"
msgid ""
"When this operation's over, I'll take\n"
"you to a hot spring spa!\p"
"That's what our leader said.\n"
"I can't wait!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1073
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_SeaIsSoWet"
msgid ""
"The sea is just so vast…\p"
"Could the sea have been made by\n"
"the tears shed by POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1078
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_SinkOldBoats"
msgid ""
"Do you know what they do with old\n"
"ships that become too creaky to sail?\p"
"They sink them in the sea so they\n"
"become habitats for POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1084
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_BuyTooMuch"
msgid ""
"Whenever I visit here, I get carried\n"
"away and buy too much.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1088
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_GetNameRaterToHelpYou"
msgid ""
"If you want to change your POKéMON's\n"
"nickname, you'll have to get the NAME\l"
"RATER to help you.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1093
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_CantChangeTradeMonName"
msgid ""
"Any POKéMON you get in a trade,\n"
"you can't change its nickname.\p"
"The original TRAINER's love for that\n"
"POKéMON is in the nickname.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1099
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_BattleTentBuiltRecently"
msgid ""
"Recently, a BATTLE TENT was built\n"
"in SLATEPORT.\p"
"GYMS are fun, but the BATTLE TENT's\n"
"awesome in its own way.\p"
"You should go find tough POKéMON\n"
"for the BATTLE TENT!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1107
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_CaptSternBeingInterviewed"
msgid ""
"I was hoping that it was a famous star\n"
"so I could get an autograph.\p"
"But who's that being interviewed?\n"
"Isn't that CAPT. STERN?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1113
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_InterviewerSoCool"
msgid ""
"That lady interviewer is so cool\n"
"and pretty.\p"
"When I grow up, I'm going to be\n"
"an international journalist!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1119
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_SternSaysDiscoveredSomething"
msgid ""
"CAPT. STERN says they discovered\n"
"something at the bottom of the sea.\p"
"I wonder what it is?\n"
"What could it be?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1125
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_CaptainComeBackWithBigFish"
msgid ""
"What's going on here?\p"
"Did the good CAPTAIN come back with\n"
"a big fish from the ocean floor?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1130
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_AmIOnTV"
msgid ""
"Hey! Are you watching?\n"
"Am I on TV?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1134
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_CaptainsACelebrity"
msgid ""
"A TV interview! Here!\n"
"The CAPTAIN's a celebrity!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1138
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_BigSmileForCamera"
msgid ""
"TY: Okay, CAPT. STERN, a big smile\n"
"for the camera!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1142
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_MostInvaluableExperience"
msgid ""
"GABBY: I see, I see. You've had a most\n"
"invaluable experience…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1146
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_SternMoveAheadWithExploration"
msgid ""
"CAPT. STERN: Yes, indeed. We intend to\n"
"move ahead with our exploration.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1150
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_GabbyWonderfulThanksForInterview"
msgid ""
"GABBY: That's wonderful, CAPT. STERN!\n"
"Thank you for taking the time from\l"
"your busy schedule to talk to us.\p"
"We hope we can interview you again\n"
"with news of more discoveries!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1157
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_SternWhewFirstInterview"
msgid ""
"CAPT. STERN: Whew…\p"
"That was my first time to be filmed for\n"
"TV. That was nerve-wracking.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1162
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_OhPlayerWeMadeDiscovery"
msgid ""
"Oh! {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"You're looking great!\p"
"We made a huge discovery on our last\n"
"seafloor exploration.\p"
"We found an underwater cavern on\n"
"ROUTE 128.\p"
"We think it's the habitat of a POKéMON\n"
"that's said to have been long extinct.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1172
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_AquaWillAssumeControlOfSubmarine"
msgid ""
"Fufufu…\n"
"CAPT. STERN, I presume.\p"
"We of TEAM AQUA will assume\n"
"control of your submarine!\p"
"Your objections are meaningless!\n"
"We expect your total cooperation!\p"
"Fufufu…\n"
"Just watch and learn what TEAM\l"
"AQUA has planned!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1183
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_SternWhatWasAllThat"
msgid ""
"CAPT. STERN: What was that all about?\p"
"It sounded like someone using\n"
"a megaphone…\p"
"Where did it come from?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1189
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_FromHarborTryingToTakeSub"
msgid ""
"It's from the HARBOR!\p"
"The submarine!\n"
"They're trying to take it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1194
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_PleaseComeWithMe"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"Please, come with me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1198
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_BattleTentSign"
msgid ""
"BATTLE TENT SLATEPORT SITE\n"
"“Find it! The ultimate POKéMON!”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1202
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_SternsShipyardWantedSign"
msgid ""
"STERN'S SHIPYARD\p"
"“Wanted: A sailor capable of sailing\n"
"in all currents.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1207
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_SternsShipyardNearsCompletion"
msgid ""
"STERN'S SHIPYARD\p"
"“The ferry S.S. TIDAL nears\n"
"completion for serving the ports of\l"
"SLATEPORT and LILYCOVE.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1213
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_SternsShipyardFerryComplete"
msgid ""
"STERN'S SHIPYARD\p"
"“Boarding of the SLATEPORT-LILYCOVE\n"
"ferry S.S. TIDAL is handled at the\l"
"HARBOR.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1219
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_PokemonFanClubSign"
msgid ""
"POKéMON FAN CLUB\n"
"“Calling all fans of POKéMON!”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1223
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_OceanicMuseumSign"
msgid ""
"“The endless sea sustains\n"
"all life.”\p"
"OCEANIC MUSEUM$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1228
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_CitySign"
msgid ""
"SLATEPORT CITY\p"
"“The port where people and POKéMON\n"
"cross paths.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1233
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_MarketSign"
msgid ""
"SLATEPORT MARKET\n"
"“Unique items found nowhere else!”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1237
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_HarborFerryUnderConstruction"
msgid ""
"SLATEPORT HARBOR\p"
"“The ferry S.S. TIDAL is under\n"
"construction in the SHIPYARD.\p"
"“Service is scheduled to begin\n"
"shortly.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1244
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_HarborSign"
msgid ""
"SLATEPORT HARBOR\p"
"“Enjoy a delightful cruise on\n"
"the ferry S.S. TIDAL.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1249
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_NameRatersHouseSign"
msgid ""
"NAME RATER'S HOUSE\n"
"“POKéMON nicknames rated.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1253
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_ExplainBerries"
msgid ""
"If a wild POKéMON gets hurt, it heals\n"
"itself by chewing on BERRIES.\p"
"Did you know that?\p"
"Somebody saw that and got the idea\n"
"of making medicine from BERRIES.\p"
"Did you know that?\p"
"To turn BERRIES into medicine,\n"
"they must be crushed into powder.\p"
"Did you know that?\p"
"You seem to have an interest\n"
"in BERRIES!\p"
"I've got something good for someone\n"
"like you.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1268
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_ExplainBerryPowder"
msgid ""
"I recently had machines installed at\n"
"POKéMON CENTERS for crushing BERRIES.\p"
"The BERRY CRUSH machines are at\n"
"the DIRECT CORNER upstairs.\p"
"Did you know?\p"
"Could you make BERRY POWDER for\n"
"me using those machines?\p"
"I can make you all sorts of medicine\n"
"if you bring me lots of BERRY POWDER.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1279
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_BroughtMeSomeBerryPowder"
msgid ""
"Have you brought me some\n"
"BERRY POWDER?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1283
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_ExchangeWhatWithIt"
msgid ""
"What would you like to exchange\n"
"it with?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1287
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_ExchangeBerryPowderForItem"
msgid ""
"Okay, you want to exchange your\n"
"BERRY POWDER for one {STR_VAR_1}?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1291
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_DontHaveEnoughBerryPowder"
msgid ""
"Oh, dear. You don't have enough\n"
"BERRY POWDER.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1295
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_FineBerryPowderTradeSomethingElse"
msgid ""
"This is fine BERRY POWDER.\n"
"It will make excellent medicine.\p"
"Would you like to trade more of your\n"
"BERRY POWDER for something else?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1301
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_WhenYouGetMoreBringItToMe"
msgid ""
"Okay! When you get some more\n"
"BERRY POWDER, bring it to me, please!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1305
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_ComeBackToTradeBerryPowder"
msgid ""
"Come back if you'd like to trade your\n"
"BERRY POWDER for some medicine.\p"
"I'm always running a bazaar here.\p"
"Did you know?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1311
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_YouDroveTeamAquaAway"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: Huh?\n"
"I'm sure I met you somewhere before.\p"
"Have I introduced myself to you?\n"
"If not, my name's SCOTT.\p"
"I just saw TEAM AQUA run away from\n"
"here like they were stung.\p"
"Let me guess--you drove them away?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1320
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_MaybeThisTrainer"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: Hmm…\n"
"Maybe, just maybe, this TRAINER…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1324
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_LetsRegisterEachOther"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: All right! I think you're going\n"
"to become a good friend.\p"
"So, let's register each other in our\n"
"POKéNAVS.\p"
"… … … … … …$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1331
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_RegisteredScott"
msgid ""
"Registered this SCOTT person\n"
"in the POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1335
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_KeepEyeOnTrainersBeSeeingYou"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: What I'd like to do is tag along\n"
"with you, but I do want to keep an eye\l"
"on the talents of other people, too.\p"
"So, I'll be off to roam other towns\n"
"a bit more.\p"
"Be seeing you, {PLAYER}{KUN}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc:1343
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Text_TakingBattleTentChallenge"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: Oh, hey!\n"
"If it isn't {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, let me guess--you're going\n"
"to take the BATTLE TENT challenge?\p"
"Yeah! That's a good idea!\n"
"That's a really great idea!\p"
"After all, a tough TRAINER is\n"
"the perfect fit for the BATTLE TENT!\p"
"Give it your best effort!$"
msgstr ""
